1
00:00:14,712 --> 00:00:18,572
Bonjour Marinette, tu as un stylo ?
Hi Marinette, do you have a pen?

2
00:00:18,672 --> 00:00:23,468
Oui, bien sûr. Tu en veux un ?
Yes, of course. Do you want one?

3
00:00:23,568 --> 00:00:28,700
Oui, s'il te plaît. Tu peux m'en prêter un ?
Yes, please. Can you lend me one?

4
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:32,804
Bien sûr. Voilà.
Of course. Here you go.

5
00:00:32,904 --> 00:00:37,580
Merci. Je te le rends demain matin.
Thanks. I'll return it tomorrow morning.

6
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:42,764
D'accord. Tu peux le garder aujourd'hui.
All right. You can keep it today.

7
00:00:42,864 --> 00:00:46,244
Merci, c'est très gentil.
Thanks, that's very kind.

8
00:00:46,344 --> 00:00:51,908
Pas de problème. Tu en as besoin pour le travail ?
No problem. Do you need it for work?

9
00:00:52,008 --> 00:00:57,068
Oui, merci. Je le rends demain matin.
Yes, thanks. I'll return it tomorrow morning.
